  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you set up an OnEnterCollider trigger to spawn a prefab,  (In my case, a particle system explosion that deletes itself), the SpawnObject call is executed once for each player in the instance. \n\nExpected behavior would be something like the OnInteract -> SpawnObject trigger where one object is spawned when someone interacts with the trigger. \n\nThe end result is that if there are two people in the instance, then two particle prefabs are spawned since each person is triggering the OnEnterCollider trigger. \n\nSince SpawnObject doesn't have options for how it is buffered (local/always/master/etc), this is kinda difficult to work around.",
